From 6281412ae16d43f973f9b4029cd819c32b37aa30 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: djrosebud <djrosebud@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 21:42:54 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] round1-waves-boss

- EnemySpawner: 3-wave state machine (6 drones / 10 tougher drones / boss)
  with breather between waves; pauses while player is dead; RPC resetWaves
  clears live enemies and restarts wave 1
- EnemyShipController: per-wave HP, sine-drift weave, configureAsBoss()
  (40 HP, 12-orb radial bursts, survives rams); drones die on ram as before
- Events: OnSpaceShooterWaveChangedEvent, OnSpaceShooterVictoryEvent
- GameOverManager: victory shows score overlay (Sector Cleared), restart
  resets waves + score + player
